OL,3,ANorway's King Harald dies aged 89
OL,4,
OL,5,FHarald was Norway's first king born in
OL,6,FNorway since the 14th Century. He has
OL,7,Fbeen succeeded by his son Haakon, 53.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
